IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Che ti è successo?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Mi stavi accompagnando
al pied-à-terre di qualcuno, quando
all'improvviso{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} sei scompars{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ti ho offeso in qualche modo?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Se{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} camminavo troppo lenta,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
ti preeego di perdonarmi!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ho iniziato a praticare{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0011:0000}} {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}e forse la prossima
volta riuscirò a starti dietro!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Az önce sana ne oldu öyle?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Beni
birinin evine götürüyordun,
sonra birden yok oldun{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Seni kızdıracak bir şey mi
yaptım?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Umarım yavaş yürüdüğüm için değildir.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:0011:0000}} ile dayanıklılık çalışıyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0021:}}
bir dahaki sefere sana yetişirim!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Is everything OK, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}You
said you were going to take me to
someone's house.
But then you disappeared suddenly!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}I was worried you'd gotten sick or
something{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}If you do get sick,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} please let me
know!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} I can help take care of you,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Va tutto bene, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Non dovevi portarmi al pied-à-terre
di qualcuno?
Perché sei scompars{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} nel nulla?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Pensavo non stessi bene{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ero
molto preoccupata!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Se ti senti poco bene,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} dimmelo!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Posso prendermi cura di te,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Her şey yolunda mı, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Beni
birinin evine götüreceğini söylemiştin.
Sonra bir anda kayboldun!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Hasta oldun diye korktum{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Gerçekten hastalanırsan,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} bana
söyle!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Sana bakmama izin ver,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
